# budget.env -- WITNESS (Program 8) gate ceilings (REV-C, calibrated from the measured 10,367 smoke).
# Serial per-pixel compositor + THUMBNAIL-SPACE vblank-serial moments/ellipse. Div-1 full-clock.
# REV-B paper (~5,350) synthesized to 10,367 (unplaceable) -> the moments were mis-architected as
# full-res (wide accumulators + divider = measured 3,370). REV-C moves moments to the 64x32 thumbnail
# (D3), RINGS to a second-difference DDA (D4), stamp bbox 8->4, ratifies bounded-shear PULL (D5).
# NO feature/control dropped (human Option A, 2026-07-20). Estimated ~7,430 (band 7,050-7,700).
#
# * MAX_LC SIGN-OFF (human Option A, 2026-07-20): tight-by-design 7,200-7,680 is pre-authorized. The
#   die is 7,680; MAX_LC is raised to 7680 so the re-smoke can PLACE and report rather than false-fail
#   at 7,200. Real gates: MUST place (<7,680) AND Fmax>=76 (3-seed). >7,680 => cannot place => ESCALATE
#   a feature cut. WARN_LC stays 5,500 so the tightening is still flagged loudly on every build.
WARN_LC=5500     # comfortable target; REV-C is far above it -> every build WARNs (expected, tight-by-design).
MAX_LC=7680      # tight-by-design sign-off (was 7200). Physical die ceiling; cannot place above this.
MAX_EBR=14       # REV-C map = 14 (motion-hist 4 + mass-thumbnail 4 + PULL 2 + sync/dry 3 + stamp 1). Device 32.
MIN_FMAX=76      # HD Fmax gate. Re-smoke STOPS if any HD Fmax < 76.
